The following were refactored from framer-motion to CSS or plain DOM:

| Component | Change |
|-----------|--------|
| `GlobalLoadingOverlay` | Removed AnimatePresence/motion; conditional render only |
| `ShoppingCart` | Removed step transitions; plain conditional render |
| `CheckoutPageClient`, `CartPageClient` | Replaced motion.section with section |
| Product/Blog layouts | Replaced motion.section with section |
| `PLPDesktopSearch`, `MobileSearch` | Removed motion form/buttons/dropdowns |
| `SearchSuggestionCard` | Replaced motion.button with button + `active:scale-[0.98]` |
| `FilterBox`, `FilterBoxWithItems` | Removed AnimatePresence; simple conditional render |
| `CustomizationEditorPanel` | Replaced motion.div with div + CSS transition |
| Super Admin Sidebar | Removed AnimatePresence for submenus |
| `HeroSliderEditor/TemplatePreview` | Replaced motion.div with div |
| `SuperAdminTable` / `AnimatedTableRow` | Replaced with plain `tr` |
| `ProductSearch`, `UserSearchSection`, `SelectedProducts` | Removed motion |
